sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Applicant
    participant Portal as Streamlit Portal
    participant Agents as Multi-Agent System
    actor Senior as Senior Underwriter
    participant External as External APIs & RAG

    User->>Portal: Submit App & Upload Docs
    Portal->>Agents: Initiate Automated Review
    
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        note right of Agents: PHASE 1: INVESTIGATION
        Agents->>External: Parallel Data Gathering
        Agents->>Agents: Multimodal Document Analysis
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 230)
        note right of Agents: PHASE 2: POLICY COMPLIANCE
        Agents->>External: Grounded retrieval (Vertex RAG)
        Agents->>Agents: Automated Policy Review
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        note right of Agents: PHASE 3: FINAL DECISION
        alt Approved
            Agents-->>Portal: Instant Approval
        else Escalated (Borderline / Outage)
            Agents-->>Senior: Handoff for Manual Review
            Senior-->>Portal: Human Decision (Final)
        end
    end

    Portal-->>User: Show Results & PDF Record
